{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：14:31 2026-09-21 HKT<br/>發佈時間：14:31 2026-09-21 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：14:31 2026-09-21 HKT</p><p>呂健威今天一早在烽火台緊守崗位，多匹旗下馬均有露面出操，其中威哥緊張地吼實有程馬「同心」、「好實力」、「巴閉王」及「禪勝閃亮」、各匹呂廄參戰馬備戰如火如荼，練者期望周三（九月二十三日）能為牠們爭取成績。</p><p>按圖睇有關相片：</p><img alt=\" 呂健威 (圖) 今天一早在烽火台緊守崗位，多匹旗下馬均有露面出操。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ur/sthl/6966774887a798b71d765c9b77c206e7/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-21_at_11_02_19.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"「巴閉王」。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ur/sthl/4774487541b215a286105e37f1796ead/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-21_at_11_02_20_1_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"「禪勝閃亮」。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ur/sthl/07ba184f9671d5fc6d7f3fa117d8d1a2/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-21_at_11_02_20_2_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"「同心」。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ur/sthl/8748f1c5f658bc41a6be11bbdfd7b75a/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-21_at_11_02_20_3_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"「好實力」。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ur/sthl/de4c82d4355220b0ca8dead8b5db4a6a/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-21_at_11_02_20.jpeg\"/><p>陳嘉甜</p><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-21T06:38:22.094004+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":197,"images":5,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}